internal/pipeline/tables.go contains Unicode script ranges derived from
Hugging Face Tokenizers 0.23.2, modified by merging adjacent ranges and applying
the pre-tokenizer's script adaptations. Upstream source:
https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers/blob/v0.23.2/tokenizers/src/pre_tokenizers/unicode_scripts/scripts.rs

